// deflate stream src/app/settings/catalog.cpp inflates on first use; tests/app/settings/catalog_pack.cpp compiles it
// (with node(), K, none, dynamic, hidden and the numbered label sets defined as in that test) and checks the decoded
// catalog against it field by field. Keep to what the packer reads: `[static] constexpr TYPE NAME[]{...};`
